@startuml render-job-state
'==============================================================================
' Render job state machine (render_jobs.orchestration_state)
'
' MIRRORS: docs/RENDER_PIPELINE.md §5 "The render job state machine"
'   (the ```mermaid block in that section is CANONICAL — edit both or neither)
'
' Rendered by:  plantuml docs/diagrams/render-job-state.puml
' GitHub does NOT render .puml. This file exists for export to PNG/SVG.
'==============================================================================

title render_jobs.orchestration_state — state machine

[*] --> queued : INSERT (column DEFAULT 'queued')

state "planning" as planning
state "queued" as queued
state "claimed" as claimed
state "retryable" as retryable
state "completed" as completed
state "failed" as failed
state "rendering" as rendering
state "publishing" as publishing

planning --> queued : plan produced scenes
planning --> failed : plan produced no scenes
planning --> failed : orchestrator threw

queued --> claimed : claim_render_job
retryable --> claimed : claim_render_job\n(attempt_count < 3)
claimed --> claimed : lease expired, re-claimed
claimed --> completed : complete_render_job
claimed --> retryable : fail_render_job (attempt < 3)
claimed --> failed : fail_render_job (attempt = 3)

completed --> [*]
failed --> [*]

note right of rendering
  NOT written by the render worker.
  Only the one-off backfill maps
  status='processing' to it.
end note

note right of publishing
  NOT written by the render worker.
  Listed in the claim function's
  expired-lease set, but no code
  on this path produces it.
end note

note right of queued
  DANGEROUS DEFAULT.
  orchestration_state TEXT NOT NULL
  DEFAULT 'queued' means any route that
  omits the column creates a CLAIMABLE
  job. A beatless claimable job builds an
  empty concat.txt and burns all 3
  attempts on an ffmpeg error.
end note

note bottom of claimed
  A worker crash mid-render leaves the row
  here ('claimed'), which IS in the
  reclaimable expired-lease set.
end note

legend right
  |= state |= claimable? |= written by |
  | planning | no | the queue route |
  | queued | yes | INSERT (default) |
  | retryable | yes | fail_render_job |
  | claimed | expired lease only | claim_render_job |
  | rendering | expired lease only | (nothing today) |
  | publishing | expired lease only | (nothing today) |
  | completed | no | complete_render_job |
  | failed | no | fail_render_job |
endlegend

@enduml
